    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Mahony Walsh is delighted to present No. 4 Woodford, Rossa Avenue to the market. This well-maintained three-bedroom, one bathroom end of terrace residence offers comfortable and spacious accommodation.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in Bishopstown, the property is a short bus journey to Cork City centre and within walking distance of a range of amenities including;\r\nMTU, CUH, UCC, Wilton shopping centre, Boston scientific and Bishopstown leisure centre.\r\n\r\nCombining the convenience of town living with a friendly community atmosphere, No. 4 Woodford is ideally suited to families, first-time buyers and those seeking a well-connected home.\r\n\r\nA truly impressive home that must be viewed to fully appreciate all it has to offer.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\nHallway 3.34m x 1.80m \r\nThe hallway features attractive parquet style flooring, warm neutral décor and an elegant decorative light fitting. It provides access to the principal ground-floor accommodation, including the adjoining living room, while a staircase leads to the first floor. A fitted radiator cover completes this well-presented and practical space.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 3.90m x 3.18m \r\nA bright and inviting reception room with timber flooring and a charming cast-iron fireplace with red brick surround. The large front windows allow plenty of natural light to fill the room while enjoying a pleasant outlook over the green area to the front.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining 3.44m x 3.43m \r\nThis is a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area, ideal for everyday life and entertaining. Plumbed for dishwasher with ample storage throughout and rear garden access via a glass door. \r\n\r\n\r\nStairs & Landing \r\nA timber floored landing providing access to the three bedrooms and family bathroom. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 3.56m x 3.32m \r\nLarge windows allows for excellent natural light in this double bedroom, creating a comfortable and inviting bedroom space.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 3.78m x 3.32m \r\nA bright and generously proportioned double bedroom featuring soft neutral décor. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 2.85m x 1.99m \r\nSingle bedroom with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom 2.35m x 1.87m \r\nA well-appointed bathroom comprising of a, W.C. and wash-hand basin with vanity mirror and unit and enclosed electric shower. The room features tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.\r\n\r\n\r\nGarden Details\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from a tarmac driveway providing off-street parking. The home is ideally positioned within a family-friendly estate and enjoys a great setting adjacent to a green area. To the rear is a private, fully enclosed garden, laid to decorative stone and patio. \r\n\r\nFeatures \r\n•Occupying a prime corner position on Model Farm Road, this property enjoys an exceptionally convenient and highly sought-after location. \r\n•easy reach to MTU, UCC, CUH, Stryker and several primary and secondary schools. \r\n•Excellent Bus services to the city and surrounds. \r\n•Generous accommodation. \r\n•Off-street parking\r\n•Private rear garden"
      },
